<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sk">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>whishlist</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../styles/bulma.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" />
</head>

<body>
  <div class="section">
    <div class="title has-text-info" id="final_price">0</div>
  </div>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <h1 class="title">Laptop</h1>
      <h2 class="subtitle">Price: <b class="price">2000</b> Eur</h2>
      <p>
        Framework laptop. Either 13" or 16", leaning more towards 13" since I
        don't need to game on it, but I need something to bring to work.
        Extension sockets make it easy to plugin anywhere, usefull in the
        field.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h1 class="title">Camera</h1>
      <h2 class="subtitle">Price: <b class="price">1000</b> Eur</h2>
      <p>
        I'm feeling a mid size DSLR. It's always been fun to fuck around with
        a camera and I'd like something versatile.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h1 class="title">Good climbing shoes</h1>
      <h2 class="subtitle">Price: <b class="price">200</b> Eur</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing against my stolen ones, but any serious climbing suffers
        because of them.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h1 class="title">Monitor</h1>
      <h2 class="subtitle">Price: <b class="price">400</b> Eur</h2>
      <p>
        I'm not even sure what state my old one is, but a nice monitor could
        go a long way.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="hero hero-gradient is-small">
    <div class="hero-body">
      <div class="container">
        <h1 class="title is-1 has-text-white">Ing. Lucia Helmeciová</h1>
        <h2 class="subtitle is-4 has-text-white-light">
          Bioinformatik & Softvérový inžinier
        </h2>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact Info -->
  <section class="section py-4 has-background-light">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="level is-mobile">
        <div class="level-item has-text-centered">
          <span class="icon has-text-primary"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i></span>
          <span class="ml-2">lucia.helmeci@gmail.com</span>
        </div>
        <div class="level-item has-text-centered">
          <span class="icon has-text-primary"><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i></span>
          <span class="ml-2">Brno, ČR</span>
        </div>
        <!--<div class="level-item has-text-centered">
            <span class="icon has-text-primary"
              ><i class="fab fa-linkedin"></i
            ></span>
            <span class="ml-2">linkedin.com/in/luciahelmeciova</span>
          </div>-->
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</body>

</html>
